{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/07ec61084e41300fd44eeb124c06adad.avif?t=1757595750\" data-has-big width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind and express your creativity in <i>Color a Cube</i>,\u00a0a free voxel coloring experience where you bring beautifully handcrafted 3D models to life. With soothing music and a vibrant palette, each cube you paint is a step into a calm, colorful world. Perfect for relaxing, de-stressing, or simply enjoying a moment of creative joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/3a7fec81d2f5b9d837a6fc63d0c235a6.avif?t=1757595750\" data-has-big width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download now and start coloring 18 unique models at no cost, with free monthly content updates!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/2b3eaed66aaeed7d46625748d375a334.avif?t=1757595750\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the experience, check out the other packs available for purchase, each one is filled with fun, original models for you to paint!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/a0e8337a07e925479c0daee79a272345.avif?t=1757595750\" data-has-big width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your brush and dive into the soothing world of voxel art. In <i>Color a Cube</i>, every tap of color reveals more than just a painted block, it uncovers tiny details, charming surprises, and the hidden soul of each handcrafted model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/66f40f1a42b378124c097993004d2d41.poster.avif?t=1757595750\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/66f40f1a42b378124c097993004d2d41.webm?t=1757595750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/66f40f1a42b378124c097993004d2d41.mp4?t=1757595750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 18 free models and 8 themed expansion packs,\u00a0from mythical creatures and aquatic wonders to sci-fi machines and fantasy beasts, there's always something new to discover. And the journey doesn\u2019t end here\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/315893ddfc9e004680c5e3840db1b477.avif?t=1757595750\" data-has-big width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re dedicated to keeping the game fresh, exciting, and constantly improving shaped in part by your valuable feedback!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A steady stream of new content</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0New modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Diorama's to showcase your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Extended shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0More to be revealed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to join our Discord for the latest news and to suggest your ideas!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3366710?t=1757595750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/2a5f4791d8813bbea38bb9d8b95aeb076ec1d23b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757595750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/1d2c0729f1b18d4ea3aec2d4a1105522f64ea6bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757595750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/1d2c0729f1b18d4ea3aec2d4a1105522f64ea6bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757595750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/07ec61084e41300fd44eeb124c06adad.avif?t=1757595750\" data-has-big width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind and express your creativity in <i>Color a Cube</i>,\u00a0a free voxel coloring experience where you bring beautifully handcrafted 3D models to life. With soothing music and a vibrant palette, each cube you paint is a step into a calm, colorful world. Perfect for relaxing, de-stressing, or simply enjoying a moment of creative joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/3a7fec81d2f5b9d837a6fc63d0c235a6.avif?t=1757595750\" 